# Shaping College Students' Attitudes toward the Social-Humanities Disciplines.

**Authors:** Sabirov, A. G.

## Abstract
Explores the importance of college student attitudes towards the social-humanities disciplines. States it is necessary to: (1) improve the status of the social-humanities sciences; (2) teach the social-humanities; (3) change the social-humanities paradigms for content and target orientations; and (4) improve the teaching methodology for social-humanities disciplines. (CMK)

